%T A399675 435069100840233333152508,2502394918312765866921553318,
%U A399675 11083425655131391670032230113080,40687575331199160096484278810227776,130084441846037403909563683657721112836,374977097596413814788672547192082895467806
%N A399675 Number of monotone Boolean functions of n variables with exactly 11 mincuts.
%H A399675 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A399675/a399675.txt">Explicit formula for the number of monotone Boolean functions with 11 mincuts</a>
%H A399675 Goran Kilibarda and Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="https://cs.uwaterloo.ca/journals/JIS/VOL7/Kilibarda/kili2.html">Antichains of Multisets</a>, J. Integer Seqs., Vol. 7, 2004.
%F A399675 a(n) = A059119(n,11).
%F A399675 a(n) = (1/11!)*Sum_{q=2..2048} c(q)*q^n, where c(q) = Sum_{R: d(R)=q} mu(Delta,R), the sum being over preorders R on an 11-element labeled set; Delta is the equality relation, mu is the Mobius function of the lattice of preorders, and d(R) is the number of down-sets of the quotient poset of R.
%e A399675 a(6) = A059119(6,11) = 635044.
%Y A399675 Cf. A016269, A047707, A051112-A051118, A059119.
%K A399675 nonn,new
%O A399675 0,7
